<section class="faq">
  <div class="wrap narrow">
    <h2>Questions travelling families ask</h2>
    <details><summary>When can we start?</summary><p>Send us your dates and your child's age and we will tell you what is open. Stays run from three weeks (six for the Lower Secondary academic and full-day pathways) to three months. Fees are paid before the first day.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Does my child need English?</summary><p>Not for Early Years or the vocational half day: every level of English is welcome. The academic half day and the full day need enough English to follow Cambridge lessons, and we decide case by case after meeting your child.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Can we try a day first?</summary><p>Yes. A trial day costs 1,600,000 VND, meals included, for up to three days. If your child then joins, we take it off the fees.</p></details>
    <details><summary>Is lunch included?</summary><p>No, but you can add it: lunch and two snacks, every day. Ask us for the price.</p></details>
  </div>
</section>

